      "parameters": {
        "content": "**n8n Text-to-Video Workflow**\n\n**Purpose:**\nThis workflow takes a user message, generates a prompt using Gemini, converts it into a video using KIE API, and sends the resulting video link via HTML-formatted email.\n\n**Flow Steps:**\n\n**Chat Trigger Node:**\n- Receives the user message.\n- Can be replaced with any messaging node (e.g., Telegram, Discord).\n\n**Gemini Message Node:**\n- Uses a system message you created to generate a prompt based on the user message.\n- Outputs the generated prompt.\n\n**KIE API POST Request Node:**\n- Sends the generated prompt to the KIE API to start video generation.\n\n**Wait & Status Check:**\n- Waits 10 seconds.\n- Checks the status of the video generation:\n\nIf status = success → proceed to GET request\n\nElse → wait another 10 seconds and loop back to KIE API POST request.\n\n**KIE API GET Request Node:**\n- Retrieves the generated video once the status is success.\n\n**Email Node:**\n- Sends the generated video link via email.\n- Formats the email in HTML for a designed layout.\n\n**Notes:**\n- The workflow automates prompt-to-video conversion using KIE API.\n- Chat trigger node can be swapped for any messaging platform.\n- Loop ensures video generation completes before sending the link.",
